{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e04-scene-25",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "买水给同学们赔罪  (Buying Drinks to Apologize)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "crew": "场务"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Feeling terrible after her Media College classmates were pushed out of the venue on a weekend, Bu Xiaogu buys seventeen hundred yuan worth of snacks and drinks out of her own pocket to apologise. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "这些零食和饮料一共是一千七百块，开发票吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "不开，我自己买的，能帮我送过去吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "怎么个意思，现场不让同学们站了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "不好意思，同学们，现场安排突然有点变化。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "今天让同学们白跑一趟了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我买了点吃的喝的，来给大家赔罪。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "今天可是周末，把同学们劝来真不容易。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这次实在是不好意思，我都不知道该说什么好了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "你也别太难过了，下次问清楚就行。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "谢谢大家体谅，路上注意安全！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "这些零食和饮料一共是一千七百块，开发票吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'These snacks and drinks come to seventeen hundred yuan; need a receipt?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "不开，我自己买的，能帮我送过去吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No receipt, I am paying myself; could you help deliver them over?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "怎么个意思，现场不让同学们站了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What happened, did they not let the students stand inside?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "不好意思，同学们，现场安排突然有点变化。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am so sorry, classmates; the on-site plan suddenly changed.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "今天让同学们白跑一趟了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Today I made everyone come all this way for nothing.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我买了点吃的喝的，来给大家赔罪。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I bought some snacks and drinks to apologise to all of you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "今天可是周末，把同学们劝来真不容易。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Today is the weekend; persuading everyone to come out was not easy.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这次实在是不好意思，我都不知道该说什么好了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am truly sorry this time; I hardly know what to say.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "你也别太难过了，下次问清楚就行。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do not feel too bad; just check the plan clearly next time.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "谢谢大家体谅，路上注意安全！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you everyone for understanding, and get home safely!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "这些零食和饮料一共是一千七百块，开发票吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "不开，我自己买的，能帮我送过去吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
