    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我买了点吃的喝的，来给大家赔罪。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "今天可是周末，把同学们劝来真不容易。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这次实在是不好意思，我都不知道该说什么好了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "你也别太难过了，下次问清楚就行。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "谢谢大家体谅，路上注意安全！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Even when her classmates leave upset and her wallet is empty, Xiaogu shoulders the blame with quiet sincerity. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "再见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
